# The pictures of drawing.md: a line, then a second from its end nearly
# square to it, which is offered perpendicular; a third nearly
# parallel to the first; a line and an arc from its end with the chord
# square to it, offered tangent. The mouse moves twice to each point,
# as a drag does: what is offered is worked out before the point
# follows.
cursor on
key s
move 130 180
down L 130 180
up L 130 180
move 230 189
move 230 190
down L 230 190
up L 230 190
move 220 289
move 220 290
shot drawing-1-perpendicular gw
down L 220 290
up L 220 290
key esc
key s
move 130 400
down L 130 400
up L 130 400
move 230 410
move 230 411
shot drawing-2-parallel gw
down L 230 411
up L 230 411
key esc
key s
move 340 480
down L 340 480
up L 340 480
move 440 480
move 440 480
down L 440 480
up L 440 480
key esc
key a
move 440 480
down L 440 480
up L 440 480
move 440 401
move 440 400
shot drawing-3-tangent-arc gw
down L 440 400
up L 440 400
key esc
